# In orbit with a survey camera: run the experiments every
# hour for a day, sending each result home as it comes
# (half its value, but a probe may never come back). The
# camera and the transmitter need power: the wings out, and
# a wait for the batteries when they run low.

panels out

repeat 24
  wait until charge > 25%
  science
  transmit
  wait 1 h
end
log Survey done
